From: HardDinD developers
Subject: [EXPERIMENT] um: use atomic waiter handoff with parallel runners

Rebase the bounded, race-free wake protocol onto the shared-VM runners.
Keep broker timeout and child-death handling; never bypass guest syscalls.

--- a/arch/um/include/shared/skas/stub-data.h
+++ b/arch/um/include/shared/skas/stub-data.h
